type: dataset
title: "Airmid Éireann: Ireland's Open Pharma Data Project"
abstract: >-
  Open datasets on medicines, clinical trials, approvals, shortages and the pharmaceutical industry,
  collected from official public sources (HPRA, EMA, U.S. FDA, CSO, ClinicalTrials.gov, Health Canada, NIH)
  and published with their source licences, a data dictionary and checksums.
